WEBVTT

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.870
Just as I would have expected
of the Tsurumai-tsuburi Mountains,

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.870
said to be eternal walls of ice...

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:38.460
I guess that level of Ki
wouldn't even scratch it.

00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:44.880
Oh! There it goes again, Gohan!
It's just like I said, right?

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.880
For the last three days, they've
been gathering together rapidly, huh?

00:00:48.890 --> 00:00:51.050
Ah! Oolong-san,
there's another one!

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.680
You're right!

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:56.980
Oh, only one more to go! Hurry!

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:06.900
It's cold, Oolong-san!
I think I'm going to freeze!

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.650
Yeah. I hear that the snow here
in the Tsurumai-tsuburi Mountains

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.490
won't melt under any kind of heat.

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:15.490
Just tough it out a little longer.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.500
You know something, we're pretty lucky.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:21.710
Fiddling around with
Bulma's Dragon Radar,

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:24.290
we saw that the Dragon Balls
were coming together on their own.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.090
There were already four of them!

00:01:30.130 --> 00:01:33.350
Now we just have to get there
before someone else beats us!

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.930
Now then, I've told you this over and over,

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:41.270
but you have to keep this
a secret from everyone else.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.520
Right! I've come this far
without telling anyone, after all.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:44.560
But Oolong-san,

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:45.940
But Oolong-san,

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:50.320
what are you going to ask Shen Long
for that's a secret from everyone?

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:51.950
Well...

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:04.540
Oh, yeah!

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.800
Oh! They're all together!

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:14.640
Come forth, dragon!
Grant my wish!

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.950
What!?

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:39.240
Oolong-san, over there!

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:44.000
Oh, no! Hurry!

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:51.340
Speak thy wish.
I will grant thee any one wish.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:59.180
Almighty Shen Long, revive Doctor Uiro,
who rests beneath this eternal wall of ice,

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:05.770
which even the sun that shines
so brilliantly in the sky is unable to melt!

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:08.770
That is a simple matter.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:54.280
Doctor Uiro!

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:06.210
I have granted thy wish.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:13.090
Farewell!

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:25.680
Doctor Uiro! The time of your
vengeance is approaching!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:31.690
We can now achieve the desire we have
been dreaming about for fifty years!

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:34.690
The world is yours!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:18.700
Break through the shining clouds,
and fly away (fly away)

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:25.660
As a panorama spreads itself
throughout my being!

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:31.040
The earth, having been kicked
in the face, gets angry (angry)!

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:38.050
And makes one of its
volcanoes explode!

00:05:38.050 --> 00:05:44.600
If, within the thawed polar ice,

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:53.440
There is a dinosaur, then I want
to train him to balance atop a ball.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:57.360
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:06.030
No matter what may happen,
I feel as though nothing can bother me,

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.580
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:15.590
However hard your chest pounds,
the Genki Dama will roar!

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:19.050
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:27.890
The emptier your head is, the more
room there is to pack with dreams,

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:31.600
CHA-LA-HEAD-CHA-LA

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:38.400
With a cheerful face and an Ultra-Z,
today is ai-yai-yai-yai-yai...

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.030
Sparking!

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:56.790
W- what is that building?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.590
There's an incredible Ki.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.930
T- this looks like trouble!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:05.470
Where's the entrance?

00:07:05.470 --> 00:07:07.430
C- cut it out!

00:07:07.430 --> 00:07:09.060
C- count me out!

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:15.020
Oolong-san!

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:18.480
--You saw!
--You saw!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.480
You saw!

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.450
Piccolo-san...

00:07:28.030 --> 00:07:28.070
Gohan,

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.030
Gohan,

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:32.250
what are you doing here?

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:36.420
P- P- Piccolo
D- D- Daimao!

00:07:58.480 --> 00:08:00.480
Piccolo-san...

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.770
Where's Piccolo-san?

00:08:35.890 --> 00:08:37.270
Oolong-san!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:41.060
G- Gohan...

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.070
I was sure we were...

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:45.150
Piccolo-san saved us.

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:50.070
You're right. It would take someone
like you not to be afraid of him.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.700
You really do respect him.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:57.660
But where could
Piccolo-san have gone?

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:59.330
Listen, Gohan...

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:01.750
What happened today
stays a secret from everyone!

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.040
But...

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:06.090
This is a promise
between two men!

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:09.090
Mother does worry
when I talk about Piccolo-san...

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:12.510
There, see? That's why
there's no way you can tell her!

00:09:26.070 --> 00:09:28.030
He hasn't been studyin',

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:31.030
and he won't say a thing about
where he's been for the last three days!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:37.040
Goku-sa, you're too easy on him!

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.040
Gohan's not studyin',
he's just playin' around!

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:44.040
As long as his body is strong, I think it's
okay if he does his studies like normal.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:49.050
Ah, there you go! Goku-sa, you don't
yet know what the real world is like!

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.050
If you don't study
and get into a good school,

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.050
you'll be ruined
for the rest of your life!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:56.890
I just don't think Gohan
is going to be that kind of kid.

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:09.150
Remember, Gohan! Don't tell
anyone what happened today!

00:10:09.150 --> 00:10:10.990
It's an absolute secret!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:20.660
Where could Piccolo-san have gone?

00:10:32.890 --> 00:10:36.260
I'm going to be
a great scholar!

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:45.190
Ja-ja-ja-ja-jan!
Oh, my goodness!

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:52.860
A grim-faced
iguana dump truck,

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:52.900
A quick-footed
flying squirrel super-car,

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:56.870
A quick-footed
flying squirrel super-car,

00:10:56.870 --> 00:11:00.450
I cry out
"What shall I do?"

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:04.040
Pay no mind to my
notebooks and pencils,

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:09.630
and visit Saturn's rings on
(hey!) a Jet Coaster!

00:11:12.050 --> 00:11:16.050
A voice louder
than Mama's? Phew!

00:11:16.050 --> 00:11:19.680
Could there be such a thing?

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:23.270
My-y-y-y, once it
occurs to me, I go...

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:27.060
Step! Step! Jump!

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.690
Shoopa-shoopie
shoopa-shoo, Piccolo!

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:34.240
Feels like waiting
in anticipation for a snack!

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:38.490
Shoopa-shoopie
shoopa-shoo, Piccolo!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:42.450
Listen, listen, he's strong!
He's strong, I tell you!

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:47.040
Piccolo-san,
I-I-I-I-I love you!

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.670
Piccolo-san, I-I,
Piccolo-san, I-I,

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:59.050
Piccolo-san,
I-I-I-I-I love you!

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:11.900
Gohan-chan!
Time to eat! Gohan-chan!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:15.820
Gohan-chan!

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.660
It was a dream?

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:26.370
Are you finished with your studyin'?

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:26.410
I've still got a little bit more.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.370
I've still got a little bit more.

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.130
Come as soon as you're done.

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:41.470
He never used to be the kind of
boy that dozed off while studyin'...

00:12:41.470 --> 00:12:46.100
My Gohan-chan is growin'
more and more delinquent.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.740
For crying out loud,
why should I have to fix the meals,

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:03.780
just because I broke the Dragon Radar?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:07.620
just because I broke the Dragon Radar?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:11.420
That Bulma! Just because she can't do
something, she passes it off onto others!

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:13.380
--Did you say something?
--N- no...

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.590
What is this? Everything
in the oven is all black!

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.170
Really?

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:23.100
Geez, you mess up
everything you do!

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:25.100
You could do it yourself, you know!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.100
--At this point, we don't have any choice.
--Huh? You can cook?

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.100
Let's order out or something.

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.900
Hey, turtle!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:42.110
Yes, yes, yes...

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:42.450
Yes, yes, yes...

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.870
Who is it?

00:13:45.370 --> 00:13:47.830
Is Muten Roshi here?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:52.460
Is this Muten Roshi's house?

00:13:52.460 --> 00:13:55.040
Y- y- yes, that's right...

00:13:55.050 --> 00:13:57.510
Is he here?
Muten Roshi?

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:04.100
I'm Muten Roshi.

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:15.650
What can I do for you?

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:20.780
Doctor Uiro has called for you.
You will come with us.

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:25.580
Doctor Uiro? I don't know him.
Could you not interrupt my afternoon nap?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.040
What's going on?

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:38.670
T- t- those guys!

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:43.510
Who are these people?

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:46.640
If there's nothing else,
go on back where you came from.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:09.240
As one would expect of the great
Muten Roshi. Such magnificent skill!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:14.290
Could I ask you to accompany
me to go see Doctor Uiro?

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.920
I thought I said I wasn't going.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:20.300
What are you talking about!?
Let's get going, quick!

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:27.890
Don't you care about
what happens to that young lady?

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:31.270
He's offering you
a special invitation, isn't he!?

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:33.310
Don't put up any more
futile resistance!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:37.310
My, my, I guess
I've got no choice.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:41.070
Indeed, Muten Roshi,
said to be the god of martial arts,

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:45.860
as the strongest man in the world,
you can listen to reason.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.960
What do I do!?

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.920
Old Man Turtle Hermit and Bulma?

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:02.130
Mm-hmm.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:08.340
Well, don't worry! Old Man
Turtle Hermit is the god of martial arts,

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.350
and has even won
the Tenkaichi Tournament.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.930
He should be fine.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:13.930
Yeah, but...

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:19.940
I'm sure he's been taken
to the Tsurumai-tsuburi Mountains.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:25.320
You went off seein' Piccolo again!?
Your mother doesn't like him!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.900
But I...

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:30.910
This ain't the time to be
talking about this. I'm off!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.330
Me too!

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:35.330
No! That's no place
for a child to be goin' to!

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.750
But...

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:38.960
You can't!

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:40.750
Kinto Un!

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.380
Okay, I'm off!

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:46.420
Goku-sa, be careful.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:48.380
Goku-sa, be careful.

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:49.390
Right.

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.390
Where are you goin'!?

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:01.400
I need to go pee.

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.820
The toilet's not over there!

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:14.790
How about you tell me
what you're after here, already?

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:19.670
You don't need the girl any longer, right?
Your business is with me, after all.

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:23.420
That's right! I don't have
anything to do with this.

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:25.420
Hurry up and take me back!

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:39.440
Doctor Uiro, as per your instructions,
I have brought you Muten Roshi.

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.060
Go at him immediately.

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.650
Yes, sir.

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:47.990
B- Bulma!

00:18:35.950 --> 00:18:37.280
W- what's this?

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:39.040
Just as I would have expected of the
Tsurumai-tsuburi Mountains, Muten Roshi.

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:43.460
From the greatest that biotechnology
has to offer, I have created...

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:45.460
Kishime...

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:46.880
Misokatsun...

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:48.460
Ebifrya...

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.260
...these three ferocious warriors!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:53.510
Muten Roshi, why don't
you show us the abilities

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:56.930
that the strongest man
in the world possesses?

00:18:57.140 --> 00:19:00.140
Me, the strongest in the world?

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:04.520
If you're going to flatter me like that,
what is it you've got planned!?

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:07.150
All right then...

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:11.110
Showtime!!

00:19:20.910 --> 00:19:22.910
Unbelievable!

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:28.090
So this is the man who Doctor Uiro
says is the strongest in the world?

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:36.510
Kamehame...

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:37.930
Ha!!

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:44.140
What!?

00:19:55.530 --> 00:20:00.030
Would you mind
going easy on an old man?

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:00.120
Would you mind
going easy on an old man?

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.160
How could you do that
to an elderly man!?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.160
Then that's the level of Muten Roshi,
the greatest martial artist under the sun,

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:08.130
Then that's the level of Muten Roshi,
the greatest martial artist under the sun,

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:11.170
and said to be the
strongest man in the world?

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:12.550
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.170
What!?

00:20:14.550 --> 00:20:15.970
An idiot, am I!?

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:17.340
Yes, you're an idiot!

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:20.140
And as for the Turtle Hermit
being the strongest in the world,

00:20:20.140 --> 00:20:22.810
that was fifty years in the past!

00:20:22.810 --> 00:20:24.810
In the past?

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:28.190
Young lady, are you
telling the truth?

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.980
Who's that? Where are you?
Come on out!

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:35.150
Do not take that rude
tone with Doctor Uiro-sama!

00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:37.200
Doctor... Uiro?

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.200
And I am his assistant,

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:43.160
the biotechnological genius,
Doctor Cochin!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:46.910
Doctor Uiro and Doctor Cochin?

00:20:46.920 --> 00:20:47.000
Doctor Uiro and Doctor Cochin?

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.210
I thought I'd heard
your names somewhere!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:52.380
You're Doctor Uiro, said to be
an unequalled prodigal scientist,

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.170
and his assistant,
Doctor Cochin!

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:58.510
I'm surprised you know of us,
as young as you are. I applaud you.

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:02.810
But fifty years ago, the two of you
were caught in a sudden weather shift,

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:05.470
burying you and your laboratory in
snow and ice overnight, killing you both!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:08.230
burying you and your laboratory in
snow and ice overnight, killing you both!

00:21:08.230 --> 00:21:11.860
That's right! You died here
in the Tsurumai-tsuburi Mountains!

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:14.400
Didn't you?
I read so in a book!

00:21:14.400 --> 00:21:17.190
Fifty years ago, we were indeed
buried under the snow.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:22.070
But neither I nor Doctor
Uiro is dead. Look at this.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:22.200
But neither I nor Doctor
Uiro is dead. Look at this.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:28.620
The most gifted scientist in the
history of mankind, Doctor Uiro-sama!

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.380
Oh, no! [no = brain]

00:21:36.380 --> 00:21:39.220
You may have been attempting to make a joke,
but I'm not giving you any sitting cushions!

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:44.640
Young lady, as you can see,
Doctor Uiro's brain is still alive.

00:21:44.640 --> 00:21:47.060
It was written that
the two devilish scientists

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:51.100
had received punishment from
above for pursuing their own research!

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:58.240
Be silent! Mankind's limited
intelligence couldn't keep up to our level.

00:21:58.240 --> 00:22:04.240
Young lady, who is
the strongest in the world?

00:22:04.660 --> 00:22:07.240
Son-kun, of course!

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:09.460
Son-kun?

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.500
Son Goku!

00:22:11.670 --> 00:22:14.080
Son Goku?

00:22:14.090 --> 00:22:17.670
You guys couldn't stand up to him
even if you all ganged up!

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:19.670
W- what!?

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:23.300
Interesting.
Where is he?

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:26.260
What are you going to do
with Son-kun if you find him!?

00:22:26.260 --> 00:22:29.270
The most brilliant brain
in the world, Doctor Uiro,

00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:34.730
will take over the body
of the strongest man in the world,

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:36.690
and be restored!

00:22:36.690 --> 00:22:40.070
Won't that be wonderful?

00:22:40.280 --> 00:22:41.700
You can't mean it!

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:47.490
Doctor Uiro will reign
over the world forever!

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:50.290
I will now take those humans who
treated my greatness as being eccentric,

00:22:50.290 --> 00:22:52.500
and refused to acknowledge it-

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:57.920
those who utterly cast me into oblivion,
and exact my revenge on them,

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:00.300
ruling over them
with my scientific power!

00:23:00.300 --> 00:23:04.510
--What kind of nonsense is that-
--You shut up!

00:23:04.510 --> 00:23:09.720
You must know about how, three days ago,
the woodland area near Metro South

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:13.520
turned into a desert
in an instant, right?

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:20.730
You're not saying-

00:23:20.740 --> 00:23:23.150
I am saying.

00:23:23.150 --> 00:23:27.160
Throughout the world, there is an uproar
over the cause of it being unknown,

00:23:27.160 --> 00:23:32.080
but with Doctor Uiro and myself
working on it, it was a simple matter.

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:35.170
You could say that it
was just the first scene

00:23:35.170 --> 00:23:38.750
of the vengeance we are
beginning to take on humanity.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.170
A drop in the bucket
of our noble blood,

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:47.760
which is recreating the magnificent
world that Doctor Uiro will reign over!

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:50.760
There is no longer anything
that is impossible for us!

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:52.770
We are capable of
turning the whole world

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:56.190
into a desert in an instant,
if we wanted to!

00:23:56.190 --> 00:24:00.320
Young lady, where is
this man named Son Goku?

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:03.360
Wait! Wait!

00:24:03.360 --> 00:24:05.990
There is an incredibly
powerful Ki approaching!

00:24:11.790 --> 00:24:12.740
Son-kun!

00:24:12.750 --> 00:24:12.790
Son-kun!

00:24:12.790 --> 00:24:14.000
What?

00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:24.210
It's an incredible Ki.
Son Goku...

00:24:24.220 --> 00:24:29.220
Indeed, this could be
the man worthy of being my body.

00:24:29.220 --> 00:24:30.800
Son-kun...

00:24:34.230 --> 00:24:36.600
Gohan-chan...

00:24:36.600 --> 00:24:41.360
My Gohan-chan is growin'
further and further away from me.

00:24:41.360 --> 00:24:43.570
Forgive me, Mother.

00:24:54.410 --> 00:24:56.830
What do we have here?

00:24:56.830 --> 00:25:00.830
Are you Son Goku?

00:25:00.840 --> 00:25:04.840
That's right! Where are
Old Man Turtle Hermit and Bulma!?

00:25:04.840 --> 00:25:09.840
They're all the way inside this fortress!
Try coming on in, if you can!

00:25:21.060 --> 00:25:23.690
Whoa, it's cold!

00:25:31.450 --> 00:25:35.290
Now, show me
what you're capable of.

00:25:35.290 --> 00:25:39.460
My ferocious warriors,
kill the intruder!

00:25:55.310 --> 00:25:56.470
That's cold!

00:26:15.490 --> 00:26:18.540
It's so cold, I can't
muster enough strength!

00:26:29.510 --> 00:26:31.130
What's this?

00:26:47.320 --> 00:26:49.110
Ain't no stopping them like this!

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:29.520
You're a stretchy one, huh?

00:27:33.530 --> 00:27:34.740
All right!

00:27:51.590 --> 00:27:54.220
Kaio-ken!!

00:28:12.740 --> 00:28:15.360
I guess I've warmed up a little, now...

00:28:55.450 --> 00:28:57.240
That ain't the Zanzo-ken technique!

00:28:57.240 --> 00:29:00.030
When he disappears,
his Ki disappears as well!

00:29:44.790 --> 00:29:46.580
It's so cold, my power...

00:29:49.500 --> 00:29:56.050
Son Goku! You won't break free of
Ebifrya's Toketsu-ken technique so easily!

00:29:56.050 --> 00:29:59.090
Go on and die inside that frozen hell!

00:30:02.680 --> 00:30:04.260
Finish him!

00:30:13.440 --> 00:30:14.440
Gohan!

00:30:14.440 --> 00:30:15.440
Father!

00:30:22.450 --> 00:30:24.070
Kuririn!

00:30:24.330 --> 00:30:27.540
Goku, is this any way to treat a friend?
Don't forget, I'm here for you, too.

00:30:27.540 --> 00:30:29.290
Hey! Do not...

00:30:29.290 --> 00:30:31.290
...interfere!

00:30:38.800 --> 00:30:40.220
Gohan!

00:31:08.450 --> 00:31:09.620
Kuririn-san!

00:31:39.940 --> 00:31:46.160
Kaio-ken!!

00:32:26.780 --> 00:32:27.780
Gohan!

00:32:31.080 --> 00:32:32.080
Kuririn!

00:32:32.080 --> 00:32:33.700
Goku!

00:32:34.080 --> 00:32:37.080
Hurry and thaw us!
We're cold!

00:32:44.220 --> 00:32:46.220
He's the real thing.

00:32:48.470 --> 00:32:52.260
At last, having awakened
after sleeping for fifty years,

00:32:52.260 --> 00:32:55.930
the time has arrived when I,
Doctor Uiro, will rule the world!

00:32:55.940 --> 00:32:59.730
I have decided
to take your body!

00:33:04.190 --> 00:33:07.240
I'm still cold! It feels like
I'm going to freeze solid!

00:33:07.240 --> 00:33:10.280
Although, we were frozen
solid just a minute ago...

00:33:10.280 --> 00:33:14.200
By the way, Goku,
is Muten Roshi-sama up ahead?

00:33:14.200 --> 00:33:18.160
Yeah. They said he was all the way inside.
Let's keep going as far as we can!

00:33:18.170 --> 00:33:18.250
Yeah. They said he was all the way inside.
Let's keep going as far as we can!

00:33:18.250 --> 00:33:21.080
That's it, run!
Come quickly!

00:33:41.110 --> 00:33:42.940
Looks like we go up.

00:33:58.370 --> 00:33:59.460
Bulma!

00:34:00.500 --> 00:34:02.130
Son-kun!

00:34:07.340 --> 00:34:09.130
--Goku!
--Father!

00:34:12.340 --> 00:34:16.600
Glad you could come,
strongest guy in the world.

00:34:18.100 --> 00:34:20.560
Who are you!?
Where's the Old Timer!?

00:34:20.560 --> 00:34:23.350
Muten Roshi is sleeping quietly.

00:34:23.360 --> 00:34:27.320
I will be altering him soon,
like those other three.

00:34:27.320 --> 00:34:28.740
What!?

00:34:31.860 --> 00:34:33.660
Father, over there!

00:34:39.960 --> 00:34:41.370
W- what is that?

00:34:41.370 --> 00:34:44.000
Father, that's a human brain!

00:34:45.920 --> 00:34:48.710
That's the brain of Doctor Uiro,
the devilish scientist

00:34:48.710 --> 00:34:50.800
who plotted to conquer
the world fifty years ago

00:34:50.800 --> 00:34:53.890
with his mad scientific power!

00:34:53.890 --> 00:34:57.810
How rude of you to call the greatest
mind of the century a devilish scientist!

00:34:57.810 --> 00:35:01.180
You are devils, for carrying
out your own selfish research,

00:35:01.190 --> 00:35:03.940
--just because you're the ones
who say you can!
--What!?

00:35:03.940 --> 00:35:06.980
How can you go on living,
even taking on that form!?

00:35:06.980 --> 00:35:09.650
You should have
perished a long time ago!

00:35:09.650 --> 00:35:12.450
Can you really go on
living as just a brain?

00:35:13.990 --> 00:35:16.830
We have been able
to accomplish it!

00:35:16.830 --> 00:35:21.000
For us to enjoy outright
freedom in this world,

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:26.840
we must alter all worthless humans,
and make you kneel before Doctor Uiro.

00:35:26.840 --> 00:35:29.630
In order for us to realize
this ideal world,

00:35:29.630 --> 00:35:32.840
and with our ambitions
only half fulfilled,

00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:36.850
I arranged for the fallen Doctor
Uiro's brain to at least go on living.

00:35:36.850 --> 00:35:41.430
It was our dream that one day,
Doctor Uiro and I would rule the world.

00:35:41.430 --> 00:35:47.810
However, the eternal ice and snow
had Doctor Uiro completely locked inside.

00:35:47.820 --> 00:35:50.440
The heavens must have been jealous

00:35:50.440 --> 00:35:54.450
of Doctor Uiro's unlimited
power and noble thinking.

00:35:54.450 --> 00:35:59.450
But thanks to the Dragon Balls,
the time of our vengeance has arrived!

00:35:59.450 --> 00:36:05.670
Son Goku, I want your body,
the strongest one in the world.

00:36:05.830 --> 00:36:06.880
You what?

00:36:06.880 --> 00:36:10.880
Doctor Uiro plans to
take over your body, Son-kun!

00:36:10.880 --> 00:36:17.050
It'll be like swapping your low-grade
brain for Doctor Uiro's high-grade brain.

00:36:17.050 --> 00:36:21.470
Don't be ridiculous!
My brain and my body belong to me!

00:36:21.470 --> 00:36:21.510
That will not do!
Your body belongs to me!

00:36:21.520 --> 00:36:25.480
That will not do!
Your body belongs to me!

00:36:34.950 --> 00:36:36.950
--Father!
--Goku!

00:36:39.490 --> 00:36:40.490
Son-kun!

00:36:42.490 --> 00:36:44.080
Father!

00:36:44.080 --> 00:36:45.910
Stop!

00:36:45.920 --> 00:36:50.500
That should just about do it.
Let that other man dispose of him.

00:36:50.500 --> 00:36:53.300
--Yes, sir.
--I'm going to let you have it!

00:36:57.930 --> 00:36:59.090
Gohan!

00:37:05.520 --> 00:37:06.730
P- Piccolo?

00:37:11.480 --> 00:37:12.690
Piccolo-san!

00:37:30.130 --> 00:37:34.960
Son Goku, you're the genuine article.
I'm liking you more and more.

00:37:36.550 --> 00:37:38.130
Piccolo...

00:37:40.970 --> 00:37:43.180
Piccolo-san!

00:37:43.180 --> 00:37:45.350
Piccolo-sama,
you came for me, right?

00:37:45.350 --> 00:37:47.180
Gohan! Don't get close to him!

00:37:51.940 --> 00:37:53.110
Piccolo-san!

00:38:21.180 --> 00:38:23.180
Piccolo-san! Father!

00:38:26.180 --> 00:38:30.180
I made it possible
for us to control the great evil

00:38:30.190 --> 00:38:32.980
within Piccolo Daimao's heart!

00:38:32.980 --> 00:38:35.980
Make him stop!
Turn Piccolo-san back to the way he was!

00:38:35.980 --> 00:38:36.020
I can't do that. He is now
an obedient servant of Doctor Uiro!

00:38:36.030 --> 00:38:41.150
I can't do that. He is now
an obedient servant of Doctor Uiro!

00:38:42.990 --> 00:38:44.570
Darn it!

00:38:48.040 --> 00:38:50.040
Stop it, Piccolo!

00:39:02.630 --> 00:39:05.050
Piccolo-san, stop!

00:39:05.050 --> 00:39:07.430
I'm asking you,
please stop!

00:39:13.190 --> 00:39:16.610
Whatever! Just get
me out of here, quick!

00:39:16.610 --> 00:39:18.190
That's easy for you to say...

00:39:21.820 --> 00:39:25.200
Looks like you have to cut
the power source somewhere.

00:39:25.200 --> 00:39:27.830
Either that,
or demolish it.

00:39:32.080 --> 00:39:34.670
Stop it, Piccolo-san!

00:39:34.670 --> 00:39:36.290
Piccolo-san!

00:39:39.300 --> 00:39:41.260
Gohan! Get away from him!

00:39:41.260 --> 00:39:44.090
He ain't the same
Piccolo he usually is!

00:40:03.650 --> 00:40:06.860
Piccolo-san,
you aren't a bad person!

00:40:06.870 --> 00:40:08.450
Stop doing this!

00:40:09.450 --> 00:40:11.080
Watch out, Gohan!

00:40:19.710 --> 00:40:21.130
Gohan!

00:40:22.300 --> 00:40:24.300
Gohan!

00:40:40.110 --> 00:40:42.320
Piccolo-san...
Father...

00:40:55.250 --> 00:40:58.960
It's all... it's all...

00:40:58.960 --> 00:41:02.340
It's all your fault!

00:41:13.020 --> 00:41:15.680
What power is this!?

00:41:15.680 --> 00:41:18.520
I won't let you
get away with this!

00:41:19.400 --> 00:41:23.190
Kid, what can you do?

00:41:23.190 --> 00:41:27.030
Stop, Cochin! Do not
provoke him any further!

00:41:27.030 --> 00:41:30.030
This is all your fault!

00:41:30.030 --> 00:41:34.040
Kid, you should go home
and suck at your mommy's teats!

00:41:34.040 --> 00:41:36.040
Cochin, stop!

00:41:36.040 --> 00:41:39.420
This is all your fault!

00:42:09.360 --> 00:42:11.410
Release Bulma-san!

00:42:59.410 --> 00:43:00.620
Piccolo!

00:43:02.420 --> 00:43:05.080
--Son!
--Piccolo-san!

00:43:05.090 --> 00:43:06.250
Gohan...

00:43:09.840 --> 00:43:14.840
I wasn't expecting my turn to come.
You guys are promising.

00:43:31.110 --> 00:43:32.490
Doctor Uiro!

00:44:03.890 --> 00:44:06.690
Doctor Uiro!

00:44:32.260 --> 00:44:36.880
Doc... tor... U... i... ro...

00:44:50.770 --> 00:44:56.650
Son Goku, if I had your body,
I would have no use for this ugly one.

00:44:56.660 --> 00:44:59.160
I am about to be
reborn as the mightiest,

00:44:59.160 --> 00:45:05.000
the most exalted,
flesh-and-blood Doctor Uiro!

00:45:05.960 --> 00:45:07.580
You've got to be kidding!

00:45:11.460 --> 00:45:14.090
I can sense an incredible power!

00:45:17.430 --> 00:45:23.390
That's the guy who controlled me
to do as he said? He's going to pay!

00:45:23.390 --> 00:45:25.810
He's going to pay for that!

00:45:31.400 --> 00:45:32.610
Piccolo-san!

00:45:33.570 --> 00:45:36.570
You think I can be
defeated by you!?

00:45:38.570 --> 00:45:40.570
A Kamehame-ha blast!

00:45:40.570 --> 00:45:43.410
Kamehame...

00:45:43.410 --> 00:45:46.200
Ha!!

00:45:53.170 --> 00:45:54.380
It didn't work!

00:46:16.860 --> 00:46:18.070
Kuririn!

00:46:19.360 --> 00:46:22.360
So I ain't going to have any
effect unless I use Kaio-ken, huh?

00:46:29.250 --> 00:46:30.620
Stop, Gohan!

00:46:52.020 --> 00:46:53.650
Die!!

00:46:58.240 --> 00:47:00.240
Extend, Nyoi-bo!

00:47:24.470 --> 00:47:25.470
Piccolo!

00:47:32.440 --> 00:47:34.850
I'll do all I can
while my body holds out!

00:47:38.480 --> 00:47:43.110
Kaio-ken,
times three!!

00:47:58.920 --> 00:48:01.130
Ka... me...

00:48:01.130 --> 00:48:03.340
ha... me...

00:48:03.340 --> 00:48:04.720
Ha!!

00:48:15.480 --> 00:48:18.310
Times four!!

00:48:46.680 --> 00:48:49.970
You got him, Goku!

00:48:49.970 --> 00:48:51.760
No, not yet.

00:48:52.720 --> 00:48:54.640
He's still alive.

00:48:54.640 --> 00:48:56.440
After taking that?

00:49:14.370 --> 00:49:17.580
Son Goku, not bad.

00:49:17.580 --> 00:49:22.540
At this point, I'll use all
of the energy that I can produce,

00:49:22.550 --> 00:49:22.630
At this point, I'll use all
of the energy that I can produce,

00:49:22.630 --> 00:49:26.670
and blow you and the
rest of the earth away!

00:49:37.140 --> 00:49:40.020
Everyone, you're in danger!
Get out of here!

00:49:40.020 --> 00:49:41.560
What about you, Father?

00:49:41.560 --> 00:49:43.610
My last resort!

00:49:43.610 --> 00:49:46.570
I'll stay here and let him
have it with a Genki Dama!

00:49:48.150 --> 00:49:49.320
Father!

00:50:06.840 --> 00:50:13.470
The ground, the seas, the skies,
and everything alive throughout the earth...

00:50:15.100 --> 00:50:16.680
I can't see!
I can't see!

00:50:18.020 --> 00:50:21.730
...each of you, share with
me a little of your Genki!

00:50:22.810 --> 00:50:26.230
Not for my sake,

00:50:26.230 --> 00:50:28.240
but for everyone's sake!

00:50:33.410 --> 00:50:35.030
Please!

00:50:36.450 --> 00:50:38.450
For everyone's sake!

00:50:55.470 --> 00:50:57.310
W- what?

00:50:58.270 --> 00:51:00.850
T- there's a commotion on earth...

00:51:23.040 --> 00:51:26.340
I'm starting to gather
a little Genki from everyone.

00:51:26.340 --> 00:51:28.500
A little more, and I can
make the Genki Dama!

00:52:01.960 --> 00:52:06.580
That's it! I've collected
Genki from everyone on earth!

00:52:11.550 --> 00:52:14.380
W- what does he intend to do?

00:52:18.050 --> 00:52:19.560
Genki Dama!!

00:52:19.560 --> 00:52:20.560
Take this!

00:52:30.780 --> 00:52:32.940
Father!

00:52:32.940 --> 00:52:35.030
--Goku!
--Father!

00:52:35.030 --> 00:52:38.030
Yikes!
His Ki is still rising!

00:52:46.420 --> 00:52:47.580
Gohan!

00:52:47.580 --> 00:52:49.420
I'll finish you!

00:53:00.810 --> 00:53:02.760
Piccolo-san?

00:53:02.770 --> 00:53:05.180
We're going to stop
him with all our might!

00:53:05.440 --> 00:53:06.640
Right!

00:53:20.410 --> 00:53:21.620
What?

00:53:39.890 --> 00:53:41.470
Why is it just me?

00:53:48.940 --> 00:53:52.560
May you and the rest of
the earth become space dust!

00:53:59.990 --> 00:54:03.120
It's warm...
it's so warm...

00:54:07.210 --> 00:54:08.410
Oh, crap!

00:54:08.790 --> 00:54:11.920
To all of you on the planet, thanks!

00:54:11.920 --> 00:54:13.710
Off you go!!

00:54:29.480 --> 00:54:31.690
W- what happened?

00:55:13.690 --> 00:55:15.730
Son Goku!

00:56:02.150 --> 00:56:07.570
Hey! Over here!
Over here! He's alive!

00:56:13.040 --> 00:56:14.040
Father!

00:56:16.750 --> 00:56:18.380
Hey, everybody...

00:56:24.970 --> 00:56:26.590
Piccolo...

00:56:27.680 --> 00:56:29.260
We did it, huh?

00:56:32.180 --> 00:56:34.980
Gohan did well.

00:56:38.980 --> 00:56:43.400
Doctor Uiro's schemes came up empty.

00:56:43.400 --> 00:56:46.950
As the appetites
of mankind become exposed,

00:56:46.950 --> 00:56:51.580
a new Doctor Uiro
may crop up somewhere.

00:56:51.580 --> 00:56:56.410
However, when that happens,
Son Goku and the others will be there, too.

00:56:57.210 --> 00:57:00.790
Doctor Uiro did have
one commendable point.

00:57:04.050 --> 00:57:07.050
He did say I was
the greatest in the world.

00:57:09.600 --> 00:57:12.640
And here you are,
its greatest lecher, huh?

00:57:57.230 --> 00:58:04.650
In a time when they
laugh at sincerity,

00:58:04.650 --> 00:58:13.160
by chance, I happened
to lay eyes on you.

00:58:14.540 --> 00:58:18.960
And my excitement (and
the pounding of my heart)...

00:58:18.960 --> 00:58:25.880
suddenly (and forever)
started up (and won't stop)!

00:58:25.880 --> 00:58:33.300
No matter the times we're in,

00:58:33.300 --> 00:58:40.270
your smile never fades.

00:58:40.270 --> 00:58:50.280
Despite your small stature,
you let me know...

00:58:50.280 --> 00:58:57.910
That is what- this is what,
real courage is.

00:58:57.910 --> 00:59:08.000
If that is where- if this
is where, our battle lies,

00:59:08.010 --> 00:59:08.130
If that is where- if this
is where, our battle lies,

00:59:08.130 --> 00:59:10.510
I won't run away!

00:59:15.300 --> 00:59:17.720
I am going to fight!
